{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>據證券時報報道，OpenAI正在推進手機項目，富士康旗下富智康集團已獲得相關訂單，將參與產品的整機組裝。富智康集團主要從事移動終端等電子產品的製造服務，其母公司富士康也是蘋果iPhone的主要組裝商。如果上述供應鏈消息最終落地，意味着OpenAI的硬件佈局可能進一步延伸至智能手機，並與現有手機廠商圍繞AI交互入口展開更直接的競爭。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:58.817965+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:33:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:17:21.136722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:17.191005+00:00","content_hash":"ab6d5a95bd1f60f1a990d1e1f97cc5b58943df24fec5793fe1bafdc9d0ab683f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:58.817965+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}